1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,260
The basal cell divides again and again into a row of six to ten cells, the suspensor, which pushes the embryo deep into the endosperm.

2
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:13,554
Its lowest cell swells into a haustorium.

3
00:00:13,554 --> 00:00:17,747
The apical cell divides into eight cells: the octant.

